# Project Rules

Qiyun AI / 企云 AI

- Read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant docs before making changes.
- Cursor owns UI work in `apps/console` and `packages/ui`.
- Codex owns backend, database, worker, infra, and migration work.
- Use one Git branch per Task ID and avoid long-lived edits on `main`.
- Keep changes scoped to the assigned task and avoid unrelated refactors.
- Follow the design system and API contracts in `docs/`.
